# The pin of tests/Vectors/regexp/: Broiler.JS's conformance/vectors/regexp/*.vectors, copied byte for byte.
# Bundle sjl-11-001's part D (docs/evidence/sjl-11-001/decision-rule.md): "a pin file naming Broiler.JS's commit and
# each file's SHA-256, checked before the run". The runner (Broiler.Regex.Tests/Vectors/) refuses to run when a file
# this pin names is missing, has another length or SHA-256, or when the directory holds a .vectors file it does not
# name. Each file line: the name, its length in bytes, its SHA-256 and its git blob at the commit. Refreshed only by
# copying another revision whole and rewriting this file (tests/Vectors/README.md).
